{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Match3 x Bricks",
    "steam_appid": 3291240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While arranging the blocks on the right, you also need to manage Match 3 on the left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overlay of two colors forms a new color. Three or more of the same color in horizontal and vertical line complete the matching. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/1e93936146046032d2da5d89474b9695.webp?t=1741258027\" width=64 height=42 /></span>shows that the red diamond overlays on the red square will turn white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to find the matching in a certain number of steps, you will be punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/27df86ddecb421df249167bc8852966e.webp?t=1741258027\" width=36 height=35 /></span>The red heart indicates how many times left to accumulate to a large punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The punishment will increase, and it could grow too big for you to bear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/9bc0ff486fe0267d5273cdff4fa89a3c.webp?t=1741258027\" width=36 height=35 /></span>means that after all the red hearts are used up, there will be a penalty of adding one row at the bottom to the right blocks, and then all the red hearts will be restored, but the next penalty will be heavier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this is just the beginning, then use your extraordinary brain to challenge greater difficulties: Work out color-mix yourself; Tetris blocks no longer static; Some levels of blocks are covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to match the flashing diamonds that may appear at some time, and you can get some useful tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/e169ab361cca12c90f3b999a8ef6df1a.webp?t=1741258027\" width=27 height=36 /></span>Bombs can help eliminate the top row(s) of blocks on the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASDW controls the direction, QE rotates, and the space bar settes the block. Game controller or joystick can be used, but it requires configuration.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While arranging the blocks on the right, you also need to manage Match 3 on the left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overlay of two colors forms a new color. Three or more of the same color in horizontal and vertical line complete the matching. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/1e93936146046032d2da5d89474b9695.webp?t=1741258027\" width=64 height=42 /></span>shows that the red diamond overlays on the red square will turn white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to find the matching in a certain number of steps, you will be punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/27df86ddecb421df249167bc8852966e.webp?t=1741258027\" width=36 height=35 /></span>The red heart indicates how many times left to accumulate to a large punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The punishment will increase, and it could grow too big for you to bear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/9bc0ff486fe0267d5273cdff4fa89a3c.webp?t=1741258027\" width=36 height=35 /></span>means that after all the red hearts are used up, there will be a penalty of adding one row at the bottom to the right blocks, and then all the red hearts will be restored, but the next penalty will be heavier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this is just the beginning, then use your extraordinary brain to challenge greater difficulties: Work out color-mix yourself; Tetris blocks no longer static; Some levels of blocks are covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to match the flashing diamonds that may appear at some time, and you can get some useful tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291240/extras/e169ab361cca12c90f3b999a8ef6df1a.webp?t=1741258027\" width=27 height=36 /></span>Bombs can help eliminate the top row(s) of blocks on the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASDW controls the direction, QE rotates, and the space bar settes the block. Game controller or joystick can be used, but it requires configuration.</p>",
    "short_description": "Is it too easy to just arrange and eliminate bricks? Then make it harder and see if your brain is up to it!",
